Searching for keynote speaker AV requirements in Malaga, Spain, usually means someone who has booked a main speaker and received a technical rider: a list of what the speaker needs in the room. A keynote is the talk the whole event is built around, so the audiovisual side has to work the first time. This page translates a typical rider into plain terms, says what we supply from our own inventory and says what we source or do not do.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) supplies microphones, sound, a display or a projector, a lectern and a technician for corporate events across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. We are not a speaker bureau or an event agency. Our part sits within our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/), where you can see the rest of what we offer.

