## Brief Overview

---

A keynote speaker usually asks for the same few things: a microphone that frees their hands or suits how they move, a lectern or a clear space to stand, a screen that shows their slides, a way to hear themselves and a sound check before the doors open. Malaga Event Gear supplies the microphones, the sound, a display or a projector, a lectern and a technician who operates the sound and the microphones, from the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) at 490 euros ex VAT for up to 120 guests. The speaker runs their own slides. A confidence monitor, recording and anything outside our own inventory go through suppliers.

## Key Highlights

---

-   Handheld and gooseneck microphones are part of our packages. Lavalier and headset microphones are a separate item, quoted on request.
